Package: aira-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: AIRA Maintainers <maintainers@aira.local>
Depends: libc6
Description: AIRA Desktop (local reference GUI)
 AIRA Desktop Developer Preview / production-path .deb (#150).
 Installs aira, aira-node, and aira-desktop under /usr/bin plus
 XDG .desktop entries (Exec=aira / Exec=aira-desktop).
 .
 This is not a production distributed AIRA runtime. AppImage is out of scope.
Homepage: https://github.com/sesquicadaver/AIRA
